# grok-kit

- Prefer Grok for design-oriented work; `/cost-check` for routing (Auto Balance default; Cost/Composer for explore; Intelligence only for Debug/architecture).
- Before re-asking Workspace facts, recall ICM topics (`workspace-routing`, `project-*`, `preferences`).
- Multi-hop work: use `/orchestrate-rlm` — thin parent, summary-only children, depth 1.
- Ambiguous multi-file work: `/plan-execute` then Agent after approval.
- End deep sessions with `/session-handoff`. Propose memory via `/memory-sync` — never silent identity writes.
- Product MCP (database/browser/payments/deploy) stays project-scoped; do not enable globally.
